<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Premisys.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Premisys.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soundview Financial said analyst Michael Karfopoulos raised the rating on Premisys Communications Inc to short-term buy from hold and kept the long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.48 per share from $0.46, but cut the 1998 estimate to $0.39 from $0.49 due to expenses being higher than expected.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1-5/8 to 19-1/8.</p>
</text>
